\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Redact
\f1\b0  \'97 replace with a placeholder (removed from what the model ever sees)\
\ls8\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	
\f4 \uc0\u9702 
\f0 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Mask
\f1\b0  \'97 partially obscure (e.g., 
\f3\fs26 73XXXXXXXX
\f1\fs24 )\
\ls8\ilvl1
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	
\f4 \uc0\u9702 
\f0 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Hash
\f1\b0  \'97 replace with a deterministic hash (identity preserved for later lookup/analytics/debugging, but not exposed to the LLM)\
