\ls8\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Applies to 
\f3\fs26 input
\f1\fs24  and/or 
\f3\fs26 output
\f1\fs24  independently.\
\ls8\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Built-in detectors exist for common global PII (email, credit card via the Luhn algorithm, etc.); 
\f0\b country/company-specific PII (Aadhaar, PAN, internal booking-code formats) must be defined via custom detectors
\f1\b0  \'97 either 
\f0\b regex patterns
\f1\b0  or 
\f0\b custom functions
