\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Compliance drivers: HIPAA (US healthcare), GDPR, SOC2 \'97 sending customer PII to a third-party model provider (OpenAI/Anthropic) can itself be a compliance violation, regardless of what the system prompt says.\
