\fs28 \cf0 3.1 Why custom middleware is needed\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls16\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pre-built middlewares are generic; 
\f0\b real business rules are specific
\f1\b0  and no framework can anticipate them, e.g.:\
